{
 "help": "usage: wgsextract vcf trio [-h] [--vcf-input VCF_INPUT] [--mother MOTHER] [--father FATHER]\n                           [--proband PROBAND] [--mode {denovo,recessive,comphet,all}]\n                           [--min-depth MIN_DEPTH] [--proband-sex {male,female}] [-r REGION]\n\noptions:\n  -h, --help            show this help message and exit\n  --vcf-input VCF_INPUT\n                        Input VCF file path.\n  --mother MOTHER       The mother's VCF, or BAM/CRAM, for trio analysis.\n  --father FATHER       The father's VCF, or BAM/CRAM, for trio analysis.\n  --proband PROBAND     The child's VCF or BAM/CRAM; overrides --vcf-input/--input and configured\n                        defaults. With the parents' BAM/CRAMs, genotyped jointly from the reads,\n                        which de novo calls need.\n  --mode {denovo,recessive,comphet,all}\n                        Inheritance mode to filter for\n  --min-depth MIN_DEPTH\n                        BAM/CRAM input: minimum read depth in each person at a reported site\n                        (default 15)\n  --proband-sex {male,female}\n                        BAM/CRAM input: the child's sex, for chrX ploidy (default: inferred from\n                        chrX/chrY coverage)\n  -r, --region REGION   Chromosomal region\n\nglobal options:\n  -i/--input, -o/--outdir, --genome, --ref, -t/--threads, -m/--memory, --json, --quiet, --debug,\n  --config and the other global options are accepted before or after the command; 'wgsextract\n  --help' lists them all.\n\nexamples:\n  wgsextract vcf trio --proband child.vcf.gz --mother mother.vcf.gz --father father.vcf.gz --mode denovo\n\noutputs (in the output directory unless noted):\n  trio_<mode>.vcf.gz (+ .tbi); VCF denovo/comphet also write\n  trio_<mode>_inconclusive.vcf.gz for missing/weak parental evidence; from\n  alignments, also trio_joint.vcf.gz (and trio_denovo_isolated.vcf.gz for\n  --mode denovo). The manifest is trio.manifest.json.\n\nneeds:\n  bcftools, samtools, tabix; depending on options and inputs, also: bgzip;\n  minutes on a 30x genome.\n",
